					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1871.654,
							54.438,
							9655.254
						],
						"pointId": 350900102
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401730301,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730302,
					"content": "(I don't believe it! He got away! Oh, this is terrible... Why'd I have to go and act so cocky about it? Ugh, I'm gonna look like such a fool...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730303,
					"content": "(This Kokuchuu must be a real escape artist or something. But I can't tell them that. I'll have to think of something else...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730304,
					"content": "Citlali! Did you get him!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730305,
					"content": "Given that she's the only person here... I'm guessing no.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730306,
					"content": "...I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730307,
					"content": "...I thought I'd let him go. For now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730308,
					"content": "But I left a mark on him! So if he comes around here again, I'll be able to track his every move.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730309,
					"content": "Oh, so Granny had only pretended to leave the cave... When in fact, she'd set up a whole trap for him and was lying in wait.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730310,
					"content": "Ah, so just like how you caught Ororon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730311,
					"content": "But how did you know Kokuchuu would come here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730312,
					"content": "Because I planted the bait here. The Mare Jivari map and the bow shard — left them both on the table. I had a feeling those were what he was truly after.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730313,
					"content": "And sure enough, my trap was triggered just moments after we left.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730314,
					"content": "So you really did set up traps here after all, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730315,
					"content": "Of course. It's just that they'd never do anything to either of you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730316,
					"content": "See? What did I tell you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730317,
					"content": "So, Mr. Kokuchuu, you used me after all... This whole time, all you wanted was to find the location of the Mare Jivari.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leyla"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730318,
					"content": "That's right. I've been wondering about the shard he left ever since I came across it. Why did he leave it there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730319,
					"content": "The moment I confirmed the Mare Jivari's location, that's when I realized: It was bait.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730320,
					"content": "He was counting on Leyla's spirit getting lost, and the tribe coming to his rescue. Then, by helping Leyla, we'd be helping him...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730321,
					"content": "Oh! So he was fishing too! It was all a ploy to lure in an actual clairvoyant who could look into the shard for him...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730322,
					"content": "Yep. And somebody fell for it hook, line, and sinker...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730323,
					"content": "I'm sorry. I took the bait...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730324,
					"content": "But so did Granny.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730325,
					"content": "...! The nerve! I only got involved because of you, you little scamp!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730326,
					"content": "Either way, Kokuchuu played us like a fiddle. He managed to accomplish his goals without taking any of the risk himself. Pretty sneaky.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730327,
					"content": "You can say that again! Imagine if he'd tried to approach Citlali directly. She'd have seen through it right away!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730328,
					"content": "Although, actually... Citlali, why did you let him go...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730329,
					"content": "Uhhh... Because I couldn't risk using my full abilities here. He was a pretty slippery character, and if I'd kept him here by force, there could have been unintended consequences.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730330,
					"content": "Was it my fault for picking a bad place...? I'm sorry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730331,
					"content": "I went looking for somewhere with a wealth of spiritual energy when I first decided to help Leyla, and ended up choosing this mad sage's hideout.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730332,
					"content": "...Mad sage?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730333,
					"content": "Yeah, he's napping right behind that wall. We'd have a whole new situation on our hands if we woke him up. That's why I decided against using my full abilities.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730334,
					"content": "I do have some good news, though: I snatched the shard and map back before he bolted. So I may have restrained myself, but I certainly didn't let him walk all over me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730335,
					"content": "That's great! So he left empty-handed, haha!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730336,
					"content": "Uh, yes, sort of... The bad news is, he did get a look at the map before he left. Not that the Mare Jivari's last-known location is a huge secret, but still...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730337,
					"content": "Yeah, that's kind of worrying... What if he's got some sorta diabolical plan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730338,
					"content": "Don't worry, I'll keep tracking him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730339,
					"content": "#Also, Leyla — if it's all the same to you, I'd like to give the shard and map to {NICKNAME} as a gift. They might prove useful at some point in {M#his}{F#her} journey.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730340,
					"content": "#Absolutely! That's completely fine. {NICKNAME} deserves it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leyla"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730341,
					"content": "Are you sure? This is a very generous gift.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730342
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401730342,
					"content": "Ehh, none of us are interested in them. And if there's any chance of them leading you to the Mare Jivari, I'm sure an adventurer like you wouldn't want to pass on that opportunity.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730343,
					"content": "Granny Itztli has a sense for these things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730344,
					"content": "So, um, Granny Itztli... Do you think I'm still a spirit-duffer?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730345
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leyla"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730345,
					"content": "What kind of a dumb question is that? You saw through my illusion, didn't you? I mean, that's partly because I deliberately made it imperfect, but even then, a spirit-duffer wouldn't be able to see through that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730346
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730346,
					"content": "Ororon, give this guy some lessons when you've got the time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730347,
					"content": "Leyla, put in the work and we'll see how far you get.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Citlali"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730348,
					"content": "Amazing... Life is so full of surprises. As long as you keep moving forward, you might just run into some fertilizer in the middle of the road.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730349
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730349,
					"content": "I'm so happy for you, Leyla. Let's both give this our best shot, and who knows — we might both be beautiful cabbages one day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ororon"
				}
			]
		},
